Subject: [M152] Keep old UrlData alive across
 ResourceMultiBufferDataProvider::DidReceiveResponse()

Original change's description:
> Keep old UrlData alive across ResourceMultiBufferDataProvider::DidReceiveResponse()
>
> Hold a scoped_refptr to url_data_ at the start of DidReceiveResponse()
> so that GetByUrl() and TryInsert() cannot drop the last reference to
> url_data_ before provider ownership transfers to destination_url_data.
>
